From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:08:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Shrink per-node measurement caches and block-layout
 temporaries

Allocate and pack measurement cache slots only when needed: most nodes never
measure more than once, yet each carried a full inline array of slots. Box the
slots on first store and keep only the populated prefix without per-slot options;
lookup order and the second-chance clock indices are preserved, so cache hits and
evictions are unchanged.

Commit block children's layouts as they are laid out: items now commit their layout
at once and keep only its location for out-of-flow anchors, holding the layouts in
a side list only when align-content will move them. Geometry is unchanged.
